<custom_item>
  type             : AUDIT_XML
  description      : "1.0245 - CSPA - Ensure that logging is enabled on built-in default security policies"
  info             : "Enable logging on built-in default security policies 'intrazone-default' and 'interzone-default' Rationale: By default, these default security policies does not have logging enabled."
  reference        : "NIST 800-53r5|SI-4 SI-4(4)"
